    kind: work_item  # 1d77
    title: "elixir: defprotocol/defimpl unmodelled -- protocol and impl functions emitted as bare 'size' or under the wrong module, no type relationship (WI-fisug's title claimed defimpl; its code never had it)"  # 1d77
    status: todo_hard  # 1d77
    priority: 2  # 1d77
    parent:  # 1d77
    tags:  # 1d77
    - elixir  # 1d77
